uo;s record runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, the most of any pair. In 2025, September to October came in at 46% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 260% of normal on the middle of the grids, and the preliminary July to August 2026 estimate on grid 13665 is 44.3.</p>"}
